When it loading by default, it hangs completely, don`t response on all known
keys (example, Alt+SysRq+B). Logs was clear with 0 bytes. Problem was solved by
change card for an older nvidia 9x00 and installing proprietary driver. After
changing card was all fine. Card was checked for problems with some tests, all
were passed.

